WEBVTT

00:05:26.295 --> 00:05:30.215
we make a promise 
that we will improve our traffic,

00:05:30.215 --> 00:05:32.895
our roads and will make everything
better around us.

00:05:33.705 --> 00:05:36.045
I want to ask you --

00:05:37.015 --> 00:05:40.015
So many Indians in Silicon Valley,

00:05:40.015 --> 00:05:42.485
we keep hearing of their success stories.

00:05:42.485 --> 00:05:43.695
What is it about Indians

00:05:43.695 --> 00:05:47.265
that makes them click so well 
in Silicon Valley and in this field?

00:05:48.945 --> 00:05:52.395
SP: I think it largely comes to --

00:05:52.395 --> 00:05:56.195
most of us grew up with limited resources

00:05:56.195 --> 00:05:59.045
and our parents sacrificed a lot.

00:05:59.055 --> 00:06:01.395
They made the most of what they had